---
import KitForm from '../common/KitForm.astro';
---

<section class="newsletter-section" id="newsletter" aria-labelledby="newsletter-title">
  <div class="newsletter-text">
    <p class="newsletter-label">更新通知</p>
    <h2 id="newsletter-title">有值得看的新內容，<br />再寄信告訴你。</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-copy">新課程、手冊更新、公開活動或重要研究上線時，我會寄一封通知。沒有固定週期，也不會把單次資源領取偷偷變成高頻行銷。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="newsletter-form">
    <KitForm submitLabel="加入更新通知" successMessage="資料已送出，請到信箱點擊確認連結，完成訂閱。" />
    <p class="newsletter-note">加入後請到信箱完成確認。你可以隨時退出；資料使用方式請見<a href="/privacy/">隱私權政策</a>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter-section {
    min-width: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .newsletter-label {
    margin: 0 0 .7rem;
    color: var(--accent, #8064ea);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .newsletter-text h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    color: var(--text-primary, #253047);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .newsletter-copy {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #697184);
    font-size: .92rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .newsletter-form {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .newsletter-form :global(.kit-form-wrapper .formkit-fields) {
    max-width: none;
    align-items: stretch;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .newsletter-form :global(.kit-form-wrapper .formkit-submit) {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 3.15rem;
  }

  .newsletter-note {
    margin: .85rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted, #7c8494);
    font-size: .72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .newsletter-note a {
    color: var(--accent, #8064ea);
    text-underline-offset: .2em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .newsletter-section {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1.75rem;
    }

    .newsletter-text h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 9vw, 2.65rem);
    }
  }
</style>
